Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 17:23:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [feature](be) Add ck phdr unwind native stack collector

### What problem does this PR solve?

Issue Number: None

Problem Summary:
Add the ck-phdr-unwind phase-2 native stack collector variant. It interrupts BE threads with a realtime signal using rt_tgsigqueueinfo and falls back to tgkill, unwinds PCs in the signal handler with local-only libunwind, records PHDR/libunwind cache preflight metadata, and reports only PC plus DSO offset data through the existing debug API contract.

### Release note

None

### Check List (For Author)

- Test: Manual test
    - Built `doris_be` in `docker.io/apache/doris:build-env-ldb-toolchain-latest` with `cmake --build be/build_Release --target doris_be -j 8`
    - Smoke-tested `/api/debug/native_stack` all-thread, one-tid, missing-tid, timeout, and busy paths
- Behavior changed: No
- Does this need documentation: No

Co-Authored-By: jover <joverzh@gmail.com>
